{"orgCode":"2250","name":"Housing Development and Finance Committee","agencyCode":"2000","agencyName":"Housing and Homelessness","description":"The Housing Development and Finance Committee (Committee) aims to enhance transparency, coordination, efficiency, accountability, and alignment of the state's affordable housing resources. The Committee oversees multifamily affordable housing programs and works to streamline the management and oversight of housing funding throughout the state. The Committee operates under the direction of an executive committee.","totals":{"amounts":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":110327},"positions":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":22}},"programs":{"id":"exp/2000/2250","kind":"department","name":"Housing Development and Finance Committee","code":"2250","amounts":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":110327},"positions":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":22},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":5327},"special":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":105000}},"children":[{"id":"exp/2000/2250/1720","kind":"program","name":"Housing Development and Finance Committee","code":"1720","amounts":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":110327},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":5327},"special":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":105000}},"positions":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":22},"description":"1720 - HOUSING DEVELOPMENT AND FINANCE COMMITTEE\n\nThe Committee is responsible for overseeing the process of awarding funding for affordable housing. The Committee works to consolidate existing financing for multifamily affordable housing, create a central resource for accessing multifamily affordable housing finance programs, and manage the integration of these finance programs. The Committee considers options and strategies to administer a coordinated asset management and compliance program.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":5327},"Local Assistance":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":105000}},"apiProgramLine":true},"children":[{"id":"exp/2000/2250/1720/f0001","kind":"fund","name":"General Fund","code":"0001","amounts":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by"